# Civil War Strategy: a whole game as the Union with random events in its favour (cws-whole-game, task 5.2;
# tools/screen/README.md, "Places and rules"). In the Utility menu: the enemy made passive (Aggress three times),
# Balance Rebel ++ (which makes an event about three times as likely each month: the chance grows with the square of
# 6 - balance), Random Events Favor Union, and every end condition but the time off. In March 1861: COMMANDS, the
# "-" of Detach chosen by its key (the Union's message); the capital moves (COMMANDS, Capital: the picker down, up,
# to Philadelphia by its letter); the navy raids commerce. Then each month recruits at the first three cities the
# Recruit menu offers (so the named leaders run out) and END TURN, to the time limit in March 1865: the end screen,
# the Hall of Fame, Game Over, Quit.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each; a Retreat menu: the city it starts on; a main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn and End Game menus: Yes. The Options at the end are answered by steps.
rule 1 key space
rule 3 key space
rule 4 key space
rule 5 key space
rule 6 key space
rule 7 key space
rule 8 key space
rule 9 key space
rule 10 key space
rule 12 key space
rule 13 key space
rule 14:M text e
rule 14:E text y
rule 14:R key enter
# The title menu: Start NEW Game; March 1861, the main menu: UTILITY; Aggress three times; Balance: Rebel ++;
# Random Events: Favor Union, a key; End Cond: the four after Time off; out twice.
play until 14:C
digest
text s
play until 14:M
digest
text u
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text b
prompt
text r
prompt
text r
prompt
text f
prompt
key space
prompt
text e
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
prompt
key esc
# COMMANDS: the "-" of Detach by its key (the Union cannot detach: a message, the main menu).
prompt
text c
prompt
text -
# COMMANDS: Capital, the fifth row; the picker: down, up, p (Philadelphia), Enter; out.
prompt
text c
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key down
prompt
digest
key up
prompt
text p
prompt
state
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc
# Ships: Raid.
prompt
text s
prompt
text r
# 24 months: Troops, recruits at the first three cities the menu offers (so the named leaders run out and generic
# ones are made), out; END TURN, Yes.
repeat 24
play until 14:M
digest
text t
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
prompt
text e
prompt
text y
end
# March 1865: time expired; End Game (Yes by the rule), the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: a name; Game Over;
# the title menu: Quit; END's key.
play until 14:O
state
text q
play until 11
state
text Grant
key enter
play until 14:C
digest
text q
repeat space
